  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Adds per-character scores, retained checksum correction counts, and a reference-date parser constructor. Video fusion uses alternative character evidence with grammar constraints and isolates competing document identities. Improves extended-number arbitration, calendar validation, adaptive template independence, capture guidance, and decoding allocations. Adds local aggregate regression evaluators.",
